    "sentence_translations": [
      "His Phone Call",
      "",
      "Today was November 6th, a Saturday. At 6:20 in the morning, I was sleeping under the table, and Mom was on the phone.",
      "",
      "“How’s the weather over there? It’s really cold here.”",
      "",
      "“Sorry! I have three jobs right now; I’m too busy. I don’t have time to call anymore.”",
      "",
      "“No, I need to work. If I don’t work, then I won’t have money.”",
      "",
      "“I don’t want your money.”",
      "",
      "“I miss you a lot! I really miss you a lot!”",
      "",
      "“When are you coming to Japan? This year?”",
      "",
      "……",
      "",
      "Mom smiled.",
      "",
      "I like it when Mom is on the phone. When Mom is on the phone, she will smile. I like it when Mom smiles.",
      ""
